From d0bd33f771d9e8fa84a932932e78ccb46b523bbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Mat=C3=ADas=20Mart=C3=ADnez?= <hello@matias.me>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 03:23:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 181/209] [FROM-ML] HID: ayaneo: sync to the v4 submission
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Update the driver to the state submitted as v4: firmware LED effects
through effect/effect_index (monocolor, breathe, rainbow) replacing
the hw_pattern trigger and its ABI document, rumble_intensity plus an
index attribute, transparent pass-through of the non-vendor 1c4f:0002
interfaces with reset_resume mirrored from hid-generic, configuration
reapply after reset, sysfs teardown ordered before the transport with
IO kept enabled, the reply state under a spinlock, and an enforced
minimum eject settle time.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260925061941.75121-1-hello@matias.me
Signed-off-by: Matías Martínez <hello@matias.me>
---
